  "body": "Morning walks on the beach, coffee in the village and shops close to home, this three-bedroom Milford property puts a sought-after coastal lifestyle within easy reach.\r\n\r\nOffered for the first time in nearly 40 years, it combines light-filled living and distinctive vaulted ceilings with the opportunity to personalise and update to your own taste.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, skylights brighten the generous lounge and dining area, which opens to a north-east-facing deck. The adjoining kitchen is conveniently positioned, while the main bedroom enjoys its own ensuite and direct deck access.\r\n\r\nTwo further bedrooms downstairs are supported by a family bathroom, separate toilet and dedicated laundry. An internal-access single garage and two off-street parks add everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nSet back from the road, the home enjoys a private lawn area framed by established gardens, offering a peaceful setting to relax or entertain.\r\n\r\nWith Milford Beach approximately 300m away and village cafés and shopping nearby, this is an opportunity to secure a coastal lifestyle in a location you’ll love.",
